---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import BusinessPerspectiveNote from '../../components/BusinessPerspectiveNote.astro';
import ToolNextStep from '../../components/ToolNextStep.astro';
import CareerChangeRunwayCalculator from '../../components/CareerChangeRunwayCalculator.astro';

const title = 'Career Change Runway Calculator: Will Savings Last?';
const description = 'Find out how many months your savings can carry a career change, the date they run out, and what to do before you resign. Free and private.';
const canonical = 'https://futurecareerschool.com/tools/career-change-runway-calculator/';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <Nav activePage="tools" />
  <BusinessPerspectiveNote />
  <main>
    <section class="tool-hero container"><p class="eyebrow">FREE TRANSITION PLANNER</p><h1>Career Change <span>Runway Calculator</span></h1><p class="lead">Know the money gap before you treat a career change as a leap. Your monthly in-hand pay is the number to test your savings against, and the <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/tools/ctc-to-in-hand-salary-calculator/">CTC to in-hand salary calculator</a> turns an offer's CTC into that number.</p><p class="tool-limits">General information, not financial advice or a reason to leave a job.</p></section>
    <section class="container tool-shell"><CareerChangeRunwayCalculator /></section>
    <section class="container tool-explainer"><h2>Use runway as a guardrail</h2><div class="explainer-grid"><article><h3>Count only certain income</h3><p>Leave out freelance work, bonus or future pay that is not yet in writing.</p></article><article><h3>Protect what you owe</h3><p>Keep EMIs, tax, health cover, dependants and an emergency reserve in the monthly costs.</p></article><article><h3>Test before you leap</h3><p>Show a small project or have a talk with someone in the field before an irreversible move.</p></article></div>
    <h2>A worked example (an illustration, not your case)</h2><p>A software tester has ₹3,00,000 in savings and keeps ₹50,000 aside for emergencies, so ₹2,50,000 can be used. Costs are ₹30,000 a month, a course adds ₹5,000, and a part-time job brings ₹10,000.</p><p>The gap is ₹25,000 a month, so the savings last 10 months. If the part-time pay stopped, the gap would be ₹35,000 and the savings would last about 7 months. A change that needs 8 months fits only if the part-time pay is safe, so the tester sets a review date half way through.</p>
    <h2>When to talk to a person</h2><p>Talk to a fee-only financial adviser or a trusted family member before you resign, especially if you have a loan or dependants. A career counsellor can help test the new path before you spend savings.</p></section>
    <ToolNextStep toolName="Career Change Runway Calculator" audience="professional" />
  </main><Footer />
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .tool-hero{padding:5rem 1.25rem 2rem}.tool-hero h1{max-width:850px}.tool-hero h1 span{color:var(--gold,#e5b84a)}.lead{max-width:760px;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.7}.tool-limits{max-width:760px;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted,#b9c2c1)}.tool-shell{max-width:1050px}.tool-explainer{padding:2rem 1.25rem 5rem}.tool-explainer h2{margin-top:0}.explainer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem}.explainer-grid article{padding:1rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-radius:14px}.explainer-grid h3{margin-top:0}@media(max-width:720px){.tool-hero{padding-top:3rem}.explainer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
